Description
Hello Team,

This machine is setup quite different from what I've seen on DMU with FD and Mazak Variaxis with Spindle origin Lathe Upper Left and stock in Left spindle ( lathe z = world z).

I can't seem to be able to help customer figure out the correct planes on this machine so verify and stock models work correctly and can be used between turning and milling.
Even the tools are defined in the opposite direction from what i've seen in the past.
Sample customer part attached with his attempts at stock models.

Help Please?

TIA!
